OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAreas of
OL,6,Fcloud and some clearer periods, these
OL,7,Fallowing the odd mist and fog patch to
OL,8,Fform. Perhaps the odd spot of rain,
OL,9,Fthough most parts staying dry. Winds
OL,10,Fremaining mainly light. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving a few
OL,13,Fshowers in places through the morning
OL,14,Fbut generally drier and brighter into
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Feeling warm or very
OL,16,Fwarm with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
